# Local development
CLAUDE.md

# Downloaded data (keep directory)
downloaded/*
!downloaded/.gitkeep

# processed/ is deliberately NOT ignored. It holds this repository's
# per-entity YAML, which is what the harmonizer reads; ignoring it meant
# nothing could ever be committed here and the source published nothing.
# Unlike downloaded/, which caches the raw upstream payload, processed/
# is the product. RU has no automated fetch (mid.ru serves an anti-bot
# challenge), so this corpus is curated and its history is the record.
